  "summary": "The headline this month: Medplum earned the 2026 FHIRplace Participant emblem from Drummond Group for electronic prior authorization testing, ahead of the January 2027 enforcement date. July was another heavy shipping month — 206 commits from 28 contributors and five patch releases, v5.1.23 through v5.1.27.",
